      "text": "prophecies of Isaiah1 to be of great worth in last days, 2 Ne. 25:8. I prophesy unto you concerning last days, when the Lord shall bring these things forth, 2 Ne. 26:14. in last days, or days of Gentiles, all nations shall be drunken with iniquity, 2 Ne. 27:1. he who will not hear my voice I will not receive at last day, Mosiah 26:28. whoso does Christ’s sayings shall be lifted up at last day, 3 Ne. 15:1 (27:22). in latter day, truth shall come unto Gentiles, 3 Ne. 16:7.",
